[{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks for coming in to see us here at the agency, Joe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm one of the agency representatives, and my name's Sally Baker.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi Sally. I think we spoke on the phone, didn't we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right, we did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/5.mp3"},{"answer":"So thank you for sending in your CV.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/6.mp3"},{"answer":"We've had quite a careful look at it","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and I think we have two jobs that might be suitable for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/8.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/9.mp3"},{"answer":"The first one is in a company based in North London.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/10.mp3"},{"answer":"They're looking for an administrative assistant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/11.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/12.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of company is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/13.mp3"},{"answer":"They're called Home Solutions","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and they design and make furniture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I don't know much about that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/16.mp3"},{"answer":"but it sounds interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, well as I said, they want someone in their office,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/18.mp3"},{"answer":"and looking at your past experience","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/19.mp3"},{"answer":"it does look as if you fit quite a few of the requirements.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/20.mp3"},{"answer":"So on your CV it appears you've done some data entry?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/22.mp3"},{"answer":"So that's one skill they want.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Then they expect the person they appoint to attend meetings and take notes there...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/24.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I've done that before, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/26.mp3"},{"answer":"And you'd need to be able to cope with general admin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Filing, and keeping records and so on?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/28.mp3"},{"answer":"That should be OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/29-2023-07-28-22-13-58.mp3"},{"answer":"And in my last job I also had to manage the diary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/31.mp3"},{"answer":"That's something they want here too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd suggest you add it to your CV.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think you mentioned that, did you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/34.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/35.mp3"},{"answer":"So as far as the requirements go, they want good computer skills, of course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/36.mp3"},{"answer":"and they particularly mention spreadsheets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/37.mp3"},{"answer":"That should be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/38.mp3"},{"answer":"And interpersonal skills,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/39.mp3"},{"answer":"which would be something they'd check with your references.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that should be OK, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Then they mention that they want someone who is careful and takes care with details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Just looking at your CV, I'd say you're probably alright there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I think so, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Do they want any special experience?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I think they wanted some experience of teleconferencing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got three years' experience of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see, yes, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/48.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact they're only asking for at least one year, so that's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/49.mp3"},{"answer":"So is that something that might interest you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It is, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/51.mp3"},{"answer":"The only thing is, you said they were in North London","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/52.mp3"},{"answer":"so it would be quite a long commute for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/53.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/54.mp3"},{"answer":"So the second position might suit you better as far as the location goes;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/55.mp3"},{"answer":"that's for a warehouse assistant and that's in South London.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/56-2024-10-24-11-18-23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that would be a lot closer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/57.mp3"},{"answer":"And you've worked in a warehouse before, haven't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/59.mp3"},{"answer":"So as far as the responsibilities for this position go,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/60.mp3"},{"answer":"they want someone who can manage the stock, obviously, and also deliveries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/61.mp3"},{"answer":"That should be OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/62.mp3"},{"answer":"You've got to keep track of stuff,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/63.mp3"},{"answer":"but I've always been quite good with numbers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, that's their first requirement.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/65.mp3"},{"answer":"And they want someone who's computer literate, which we know you are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Then they mention organisational skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/68.mp3"},{"answer":"They want someone who's well organised.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I think I am.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/70.mp3"},{"answer":"And tidy?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, they go together really, don't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the usual stuff; they want someone who can communicate well both orally and in writing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/74.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/75.mp3"},{"answer":"And for the last warehouse job I had,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/76.mp3"},{"answer":"one of the things I enjoyed most was being part of a team.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I found that was really essential for the job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, they do mention that they want someone who's used to that, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Now when you were working in a warehouse last time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/81.mp3"},{"answer":"what sorts of items were you dealing with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/82.mp3"},{"answer":"It was mostly bathroom and kitchen equipment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/83.mp3"},{"answer":"sinks and stoves and fridges.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/84.mp3"},{"answer":"So you're OK moving heavy things?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/86.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm quite strong, and I've had the training.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Now as far as experience goes, they mention they want someone with a licence,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/89.mp3"},{"answer":"and that you have experience of driving in London -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/90.mp3"},{"answer":"so you can cope with the traffic and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/91.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, no problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/92.mp3"},{"answer":"And you've got experience of warehouse work...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/93.mp3"},{"answer":"and the final thing they mention is customer service.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/94.mp3"},{"answer":"I think looking at your CV you're OK there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/95.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/96.mp3"},{"answer":"So what about pay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/97.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you tell me a bit more about that, please...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-1-2023-01-18-10-52-01/98.mp3"}]
